# normalize_utils is Internal

`unified_api_contracts.normalize_utils` is internal to UAC.
- Services and interfaces must NOT import from normalize_utils
- Use the facade: `from unified_api_contracts.{domain} import X`
- Or for normalization: `from unified_api_contracts.external.{source}.normalize import X` (interfaces only)
- Shared helpers (_helpers.py) are only for use within UAC
